# Auth & permissions

Full guide: [docs/AUTH.md](../../docs/AUTH.md). Agent summary: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

## Do

- Call the API with `useApi().api()` only.
- Gate UI with `useGate()` + `Ability` from `~/utils/auth/abilities`.
- Await `fetchAll()` on members (and similar) for SSR.
- Keep invite `redirect` as a path; pass `email` as a separate query param.
- Reuse `/login` and `/register` for invite onboarding — no duplicate auth forms.

## Don't

- Check `role === 'owner' | 'admin'` for feature access (use `can(Ability…)`).
- Duplicate role→permission maps in the frontend.
- Put secrets or tokens in `localStorage` (token is the `outpost_token` cookie).
- Nest query strings inside `redirect=`.

## New ability checklist

1. API `permissions.go` + `roles.go` + policy method + controller check
2. Add matching key to `app/utils/auth/abilities.ts`
3. `v-if="can(Ability.NewKey)"` (API still enforces)
